    "primary": "adaptive-precision mpmath evaluation of the exact monodromy with z = lambda + 1/lambda propagating test (z_small = 2P/(s1 + sqrt(s1^2-4P)), P = z1 z2 = (s1^2 - s2 - 4)/2 from traces s_k = tr T^k)",
    "precision_policy": "dps = max(50, ceil(0.4343 * Lambda) + 15), Lambda = kappa_A a_A + kappa_B a_B at the scan top (z_small absolute error ~ 10^-dps e^Lambda)",
